  "short_description": "<p>Eco-friendly bamboo fruit bowl, handcrafted in Vietnam with coiling technique. Perfect for serving or home décor.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"594\">This handcrafted fruit bowl is made from 100% natural bamboo using the traditional <strong data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"292\">coiling technique</strong>. Each layer of bamboo is carefully coiled, pressed, and polished by skilled Vietnamese artisans to create a smooth and durable finish. The bowl is lightweight, food-safe, and eco-friendly, making it a perfect choice for serving fruits, bread, or snacks at home, in restaurants, or for décor display.</p>\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"777\">Crafted in Vietnam’s renowned craft villages, this bamboo bowl reflects the harmony of nature and craftsmanship, while supporting sustainable living and rural artisan communities.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1162\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1162\" style=\"width: 1080px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1162\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl-manufacturer.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1162\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spun bamboo manufacturer in Vietnam</figcaption></figure>\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1156\">We can produce this bamboo bowl in <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1094\">different sizes, finishes, or customized designs</strong> based on your requirements for wholesale and export orders.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1437\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1200\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1203\" />We provide high-quality bamboo handicrafts with bulk and wholesale options for retailers, distributors, and decorators. For inquiries or custom designs, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1402\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"798\"><strong data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"796\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"1026\">\n<li data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"832\">\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"832\">Material: 100% natural bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"872\">\n<p data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"872\">Technique: Hand-coiled and polished</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"924\">\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"924\">Finish: Smooth, food-safe, eco-friendly coating</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"991\">\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"991\">Usage: Ideal for fruits, snacks, bread, or decorative purposes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1026\">\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1026\">Origin: Handcrafted in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1168\">",
